# Path redirects (Cloudflare Workers `_redirects`). Old site URLs that point at
# a section of the home page are redirect pages in src/pages/[...redirect].astro
# instead, because a URL fragment can't be written here.

# Other feed names readers guess at.
/rss.xml   /feed.xml 301
/atom.xml  /feed.xml 301
/rss       /feed.xml 301

# GitHub Pages project sites. While alxjrvs.com was served by GitHub Pages,
# every repo's Pages site also appeared under it (alxjrvs.com/FulcrumWorks/…).
# They live on at alxjrvs.github.io/<repo>/. (Ajar's old reader, /ajarcomic,
# now has one home, /writing/ajar/: see src/pages/[...redirect].astro.)
/FulcrumWorks    https://alxjrvs.github.io/FulcrumWorks/ 301
/FulcrumWorks/*  https://alxjrvs.github.io/FulcrumWorks/:splat  301
